    "title": "Apple reports second quarter results March quarter records for total company revenue, iPhone revenue, and EPS Services revenue reaches new all-time high",
    "source": "SEC filing",
    "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019326000011/aapl-20260430.htm",
